## Task routing

Pick the persona/prompt to read first based on the task:

| Task | Read first |
|------|------------|
| Review Salesforce / Agentforce metadata | `.github/agents/agentforce-reviewer.agent.md` or `.github/prompts/review-agentforce-metadata.prompt.md` |
| Review orchestrator / Node 3 / Final Verdict | `.github/prompts/service-workflow-architecture-review.prompt.md` |
| Implement case triage | `.github/agents/case-triage-slice-implementer.agent.md` + `.github/prompts/implement-case-triage-slice.prompt.md` |
| Implement Node 4 parts logistics | `.github/agents/node4-parts-logistics-implementer.agent.md` + `.github/prompts/implement-node4-parts-logistics.prompt.md` |
| Analyze / fix Node 4 Final Verdict gap | `.github/prompts/analyze-node4-verdict-gap.prompt.md` then `.github/prompts/implement-node4-verdict-rollup.prompt.md` |

Do not duplicate content from these files into Cursor rules.
